# Only needed for the "Share to X" link preview. Without it the app still runs:
# downloads work, phones still get the native share sheet with the image
# attached, and the X composer opens pre-filled minus the link card.
#
# Get one by creating a Blob store in the Vercel dashboard
# (Storage -> Create -> Blob) and connecting it to this project. Vercel then
# injects this variable automatically on deploy.
BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=
